      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} Yes, I can still make audio source on avatar in a way that can be heard out of it's range. Tho it is way better than on the non Steam audio version, its harder to trigger it and also its more smooth/not clipping.\n\nNon Steam audio can be heard all the time with right setup, important condition is to set client FPS cap to 30 or lower FPS.\n\nOn Steam audio it can be heard only when quickly going in and out of the range of audio source while quickly rotating.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
